    "regime_notes": "H20 chronological thirds IC: +0.007469, +0.085521, +0.014506. Positive in all thirds, though the small 15-asset cross-section implies conservative IC uncertainty. Breadth was positive on 42.57% and negative on 57.35% of observations."
